  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Ugolinus de Piccolominis, sanus mente et corpore, relinquo hospitali Sanctae Mariae de Scala viginti libras denariorum senensium pro remedio animae meae, et nepoti meo Ranuccio terram meam in loco qui dicitur Montemaggio, cum vineis et olivetis ibi existentibus.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc meam ultimam voluntatem venire temptaverit, excommunicetur auctoritate apostolica et insuper solvat poenam florenorum aureorum quinquaginta.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Thomas de Saracinis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Bindus de Bichis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ubertinus de Goris</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Manentus de Rinaldinis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
